#SYNOPSIS
This PowerShell script ensures that camera access from the lock screen is disabled 


#NOTES
STIG-ID: WN11-CC-000005
 

#Code: 
New-Item -Path "HKLM:\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Windows\Personalization" -Force | New-ItemProperty -Name "NoLockScreenCamera" -Value 1 -PropertyType DWord -Force | Out-Null

#Verify: 
(Get-ItemProperty "HKLM:\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Windows\Personalization").NoLockScreenCamera

#Verification Notes
When verifying, the value returned should be "1". 
